---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description={`Privacy policy for ${SITE_TITLE} (zylvion.xyz). Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.`}
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": `Privacy Policy — ${SITE_TITLE}`,
    "url": "https://zylvion.xyz/privacy",
    "description": "Privacy policy for Zylvion",
    "publisher": { "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization", "name": "Zylvion", "url": "https://zylvion.xyz" }
  })} />

  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: July 2025 &middot; Applies to zylvion.xyz</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-body prose">

        <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>Zylvion is an independent news publication operating at zylvion.xyz. We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your personal data responsibly and transparently.</p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Information you provide voluntarily:</strong> When you contact us using our contact form, we collect your name, email address, and the content of your message. We use this information solely to respond to your enquiry.</p>
        <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> When you visit zylvion.xyz, our hosting infrastructure may automatically log standard server data including your IP address, browser type, referring URL, and pages visited. This data is used for security monitoring and aggregate analytics only. We do not use individual-level tracking for advertising purposes.</p>
        <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use only essential cookies required for the site to function (such as session security). We do not use advertising cookies or third-party tracking pixels.</p>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to: respond to contact form messages, monitor and improve site security, and understand aggregate patterns in how our content is used. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>4. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>Where the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) applies, we process personal data on the following legal bases: your consent (for contact form submissions), our legitimate interests (for server security logging), and compliance with legal obligations where applicable.</p>

        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Contact form submissions are retained for a maximum of 12 months and then deleted. Server logs are retained for up to 90 days for security purposes.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Under applicable data protection law, you have the right to: access the personal data we hold about you, request correction of inaccurate data, request deletion of your data, object to processing, and request restriction of processing. To exercise any of these rights, please contact us via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

        <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect personal data against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. Our site is served over HTTPS.</p>

        <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our site uses Google Fonts, loaded via their CDN. Google’s privacy policy governs how they process data from font requests. We do not use Google Analytics or other user-tracking analytics services.</p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Material changes will be noted with a revised date at the top of this page. Continued use of zylvion.xyz after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>For any privacy-related questions or to exercise your data rights, please contact us via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero { background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 3rem 0 2rem; }
  .legal-title { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal-meta { font-family: var(--ui); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--dim); }
  .legal-body { max-width: 720px; padding: 3rem 0 5rem; }
</style>
